    "summary": "Portrait of a young woman; single-page painting mounted on album folio. A young woman seated on a blue and white carpet before a gold bolster plays the zither. She wears an orange blouse, a lavender jacket fastened at the waist and a pink skirt. A feather and a striped veil adorn her head. Album contains19 paintings of Persian costumes. \r\nInk and opaque watercolour on paper. Album bound in green leather with gold gilt trim, with pages of gold trim. Includes loose letter (in French) on thin blue paper describing contents and addressed to recipient.",
